WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.352
In one minute, you will change your entry, then take it out of the contest.

00:00:04.352 --> 00:00:05.392
We start on the map.

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:09.627
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.405 --> 00:00:13.827
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.827 --> 00:00:16.317
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:17.663
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:21.633
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:22.285
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:28.304
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.304 --> 00:00:29.522
See the three dots?

00:00:29.522 --> 00:00:30.069
Tap them.

00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:33.637
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.002
Tap Mine.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.824
Under Homes you entered, tap Open contest.

00:00:40.502 --> 00:00:41.872
Tap Open contest.

00:00:43.921 --> 00:00:44.879
Find Your home.

00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:46.673
Tap Edit name and description.

00:00:48.351 --> 00:00:50.604
Change the name, then tap Save.

00:00:53.861 --> 00:00:55.916
To take your home out, tap Withdraw.

00:00:57.594 --> 00:01:01.372
It asks you to tap again, so you cannot do it by accident.

00:01:01.372 --> 00:01:02.204
Tap it again.

00:01:04.132 --> 00:01:06.106
Next up: Your profile.
